<http://data.silknow.org/object/98e3371d-a3bf-3e8d-a553-1c5bb2073c9b>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Double-breasted frock coat with a nipped-in waist and broad lapels faced with silk velvet. It has a crescent-shaped outbreast pocket and two larger curved pockets on the front of the skirts"@en , "The waisted frock coat came into fashion in about 1816 and became an enduring style. Typically it had a narrow waist and full skirts hanging vertically in front. The frock coat was worn for everyday purposes such as morning dress, usually with a top hat, cane and trousers. \n\nBy 1830 frock coats were made in a variety of designs according to taste, fashion or type of activity. This example has an outbreast pocket, a feature which appeared on coats during the 1830s."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/ff59bb3a-1339-3415-b9e4-b5c5d53e8ad3> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/30a30458-d9f3-3a3b-a1e0-052f77b8cc50> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/712e3275-8842-3133-8a6a-f49ec56e697e> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/5c283e1f-0005-3ce0-ad89-a6acb5218935> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/b3418ba9-184d-3498-9651-b59bfcd2232c> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/fb4cc265-46ae-395e-a9f4-872ae2f6e5c2> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "The waisted frock coat came into fashion in about 1816 and became an enduring style. Typically it had a narrow waist and full skirts hanging vertically in front. The frock coat was worn for everyday purposes such as morning dress, usually with a top hat, cane and trousers. \n\nBy 1830 frock coats were made in a variety of designs according to taste, fashion or type of activity. This example has an outbreast pocket, a feature which appeared on coats during the 1830s."@en , "Double-breasted frock coat with a nipped-in waist and broad lapels faced with silk velvet. It has a crescent-shaped outbreast pocket and two larger curved pockets on the front of the skirts"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/98e3371d-a3bf-3e8d-a553-1c5bb2073c9b/dimension/1> ;
        dc:identifier                  "T.748-1913" ;
        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs>
                <https://collections.vam.ac.uk/item/O138652> .

